{"id":"08bae348e041d0d6","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FormsI.md","title":"FormsI","display":"FormsI","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"FormsI","parameters":["g"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"FormsI"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>g</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：命题语法。有序参数：<code>g</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ FormsI g)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(forall a (implies (in a g) (@ FmI a)))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"315c023b0374de7d\" href=\"?note=315c023b0374de7d\" title=\"ZFC_FmI\">FmI</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ FormsI g)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FmI","status":"resolved","id":"315c023b0374de7d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_FmI|FmI]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务","status":"resolved","id":"593f9bdab4d60707","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"证明状态","excerpt":"本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 [[000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务]]。","embed":false}],"math":[],"bytes":702,"backlinks":[{"id":"1f855546c0e0f3c8","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_FmI|FmI]]；[[ZFC_FormsI|FormsI]]；[[ZFC_IPCModel|IPCModel]]；[[ZFC_IPCSat|IPCSat]]"},{"id":"1237e0c206e03ba5","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FmI|FmI]]；[[ZFC_FormsI|FormsI]]；[[ZFC_IPCAx|IPCAx]]；[[ZFC_Last|Last]]；[[ZFC_PImp|PImp]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]"},{"id":"153cbc8487ace6fa","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_FmI|FmI]]；[[ZFC_FormsI|FormsI]]；[[ZFC_KCModel|KCModel]]；[[ZFC_KCSat|KCSat]]"},{"id":"be278061af2d4cad","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FmI|FmI]]；[[ZFC_FormsI|FormsI]]；[[ZFC_KCAx|KCAx]]；[[ZFC_Last|Last]]；[[ZFC_PImp|PImp]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]"},{"id":"b89a6d21319eec1d","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_FmI|FmI]]；[[ZFC_FormsI|FormsI]]；[[ZFC_LCModel|LCModel]]；[[ZFC_LCSat|LCSat]]"},{"id":"ac4d577566cbe006","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FmI|FmI]]；[[ZFC_FormsI|FormsI]]；[[ZFC_LCAx|LCAx]]；[[ZFC_Last|Last]]；[[ZFC_PImp|PImp]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]"},{"id":"6e54d3c6b7fec286","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_FmI|FmI]]；[[ZFC_FormsI|FormsI]]；[[ZFC_MinimalModel|MinimalModel]]；[[ZFC_MinimalSat|MinimalSat]]"},{"id":"6162e63fe7333e7c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FmI|FmI]]；[[ZFC_FormsI|FormsI]]；[[ZFC_Last|Last]]；[[ZFC_MinimalAx|MinimalAx]]；[[ZFC_PImp|PImp]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]"},{"id":"123c0b237d7b0c5a","anchor":"ref-204","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[规范公式/ZFC_FormsI|FormsI]]"}],"outgoing":["f625c6fc1945e22e","315c023b0374de7d","593f9bdab4d60707"]}